      "updated": 1787346928326,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional Requirement",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional Requirement",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "FdMvKzrSzN69k7JVwZnEj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 379.05859375,
      "y": 609.15625,
      "width": 601.8422777252204,
      "height": 179.52734375000006,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1900809617,
      "version": 89,
      "versionNonce": 1750307345,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787346926032,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Low latency: cache hits should be near-memory speed.\n* Bounded memory: enforce max entries / max bytes and eviction.\n* Scalability: should handle thousands of cached entities and queries without large rerender cost.\n* Correctness: no cross-user/tenant cache leakage and no stale overwrite races.\n* Availability: stale data may be served during temporary backend failures when policy allows.\n* Performance: avoid blocking the browser main thread; do not use localStorage for large query caches.\n* Efficiency: reduce duplicate network calls and response payloads.\n* Consistency: mutations should eventually reconcile all dependent queries.\n* Resilience: tolerate timeouts, retries, aborts, and partial backend failures.\n* Observability: expose hit rate, miss rate, stale-hit rate, cache size, eviction count, request dedupe count, and backend latency.\n* Security: never cache sensitive data under unsafe shared keys; avoid persisting secrets/tokens in localStorage.\n* Maintainability: caching policies should be configurable per query.\n* Extensibility: allow memory-only, IndexedDB persistence, or HTTP-cache integration without changing application code.\n* Testability: deterministic cache keys and injectable clock/network layers.\n* Browser compatibility: degrade gracefully when IndexedDB or BroadcastChannel is unavailable.",
      "fontSize": 9.574791666666679,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Low latency: cache hits should be near-memory speed.\n* Bounded memory: enforce max entries / max bytes and eviction.\n* Scalability: should handle thousands of cached entities and queries without large rerender cost.\n* Correctness: no cross-user/tenant cache leakage and no stale overwrite races.\n* Availability: stale data may be served during temporary backend failures when policy allows.\n* Performance: avoid blocking the browser main thread; do not use localStorage for large query caches.\n* Efficiency: reduce duplicate network calls and response payloads.\n* Consistency: mutations should eventually reconcile all dependent queries.\n* Resilience: tolerate timeouts, retries, aborts, and partial backend failures.\n* Observability: expose hit rate, miss rate, stale-hit rate, cache size, eviction count, request dedupe count, and backend latency.\n* Security: never cache sensitive data under unsafe shared keys; avoid persisting secrets/tokens in localStorage.\n* Maintainability: caching policies should be configurable per query.\n* Extensibility: allow memory-only, IndexedDB persistence, or HTTP-cache integration without changing application code.\n* Testability: deterministic cache keys and injectable clock/network layers.\n* Browser compatibility: degrade gracefully when IndexedDB or BroadcastChannel is unavailable.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "OQkRQNjYt52PmJEh-LbKl",
