      "seed": 850978657,
      "version": 429,
      "versionNonce": 211597759,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787349262425,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* ETag is an HTTP cache validation mechanism. localStorage and IndexedDB are browser persistence mechanisms.\n* Normal API response: use HTTP cache + ETag. ETag optimizes client-server communication by validating cached HTTP\nresponses and returning 304 when data hasn’t changed. \n* Small persistent UI state: use localStorage. (localStorage is synchronous persistence)\n* Persistent/offline API data: use IndexedDB. (IndexedDB is asynchronous persistent storage)\n \n200 OK\nETag: \"user-123-v17\"\nCache-Control: private, max-age=60\n\n{\n  \"id\": 123,\n  \"name\": \"Alice\"\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* ETag is an HTTP cache validation mechanism. localStorage and IndexedDB are browser persistence mechanisms.\n* Normal API response: use HTTP cache + ETag. ETag optimizes client-server communication by validating cached HTTP responses and returning 304 when data hasn’t changed. \n* Small persistent UI state: use localStorage. (localStorage is synchronous persistence)\n* Persistent/offline API data: use IndexedDB. (IndexedDB is asynchronous persistent storage)\n \n200 OK\nETag: \"user-123-v17\"\nCache-Control: private, max-age=60\n\n{\n  \"id\": 123,\n  \"name\": \"Alice\"\n}",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
