      "text": "                React Application\n                       |\n                       v\n               In-memory cache\n              hot query results\n                       |\n                    miss\n                       v\n                  IndexedDB\n              persistent/offline\n                       |\n              stale or missing\n                       v\n                    fetch()\n                       |\n                       v\n              Browser HTTP Cache\n                 ETag / max-age\n                       |\n                       v\n                    Server\n                       |\n                       v\n                      DB",
      "fontSize": 21.86783873137556,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                React Application\n                       |\n                       v\n               In-memory cache\n              hot query results\n                       |\n                    miss\n                       v\n                  IndexedDB\n              persistent/offline\n                       |\n              stale or missing\n                       v\n                    fetch()\n                       |\n                       v\n              Browser HTTP Cache\n                 ETag / max-age\n                       |\n                       v\n                    Server\n                       |\n                       v\n                      DB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
